{"id":"5140","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5140_main_cumulus-mediocris-radiatus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>从前往英国伦敦盖特威克机场的飞机下降时观测到的法国北部的中积云。视角是沿着英吉利海峡沿岸向东北偏北看，可以在图片的左上角看到。云高的气流是来自西北方向（从左到右穿过图像），<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">1</span>、<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span> 和 <span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">3</span>处的云按照线条或街道的形式对齐，使其成为辐状云类。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© George Anderson","location":"法国北部","latitude":"纬度: 50° 22' 15'' N","longitude":"经度: 1° 39' 40'' E","date":"02 September 2013 1855 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北","cloudCode":"","code":"图像P/S代码: S.9.5","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.9.5"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/5140_syn_cumulus-mediocris-radiatus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>反气旋（1030 hPa）的中心位于英国英格兰西南部的位置。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 皇冠版权","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/upper/5140_upper_cumulus-mediocris-radiatus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>来自法国Trappes（巴黎附近）的高空探测显示，白天表面加热的不稳定性受到反气旋下降逆温的限制。云高的风来自西北方向，风速约15 kt。<br/>\n </p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]}]}